  "ruleText": "Env-A 1203.80 “Prefabricated architectural component coatings” means coatings applied to metal parts and products that are to be used as an architectural structure.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
